Source: @PACKAGE_NAME@
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Homepage: @DEB_HOMEPAGE@
Vcs-Git: @VCS_GIT_URL@
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-dkms | dkms
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: @PACKAGE_NAME@
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms (>= 2.1.0.0), device-tree-compiler, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: raspberrypi-kernel-headers
Description: DKMS kernel module for @MODULE_NAME@
 This package provides the source and DKMS configuration for @MODULE_NAME@.
 DKMS builds the module locally for kernels with installed headers.
 Device-tree overlays and udev rules are installed by the DKMS hooks.
